### 逐处错误标注
1. doing community service exert → exerts 动名词短语作主语，谓语动词用单数
2. whthin → within 拼写错误
3. spread → spreads 和前面 is 并列，主语为 doing community service，用三单
4. prople → people 拼写错误
5. keep harmony of our communities → maintain harmony in our communities 搭配错误
6. a practical chance to us → for us 固定搭配 a chance for sb.
7. capbility → abilities 拼写错误；常用复数
8. forming sense of responsibility → developing a sense of responsibility 缺少冠词 a，develop 更合适
9. neither Cleaning streets or help → whether cleaning streets or helping 固定搭配 whether…or…；or 前后形式一致
10. community services → community service service 表 “志愿服务” 时不可数，不用复数
11. positively do → actively take part in 表达更符合四级写作习惯


### 修正版
  It is widely acknowledged that doing community service exerts a profound influence on our society. All students are supposed to take part in the service within their abilities.
  For one thing, doing community service is beneficial to our society and spreads warmth to people. For example, we can clean streets, take care of the elderly and voluntarily 
assist people in need. What we do will bring warmth to nearby residents and maintain harmony in our communities. For another, it is not only a voluntary activity, but also a
practical chance for us students. By improving our abilities and developing a sense of responsibility, we can gain a lot from community service. Furthermore, whether cleaning 
streets or helping people, I will try my best to offer useful service.
  From my perspective, we should actively take part in community service with a warm heart. Only in this way can we make our community a better place.


### 优化完整版
  It is widely acknowledged that doing community service exerts a profound influence on our society. All college students are encouraged to join in such activities within their 
abilities.
  For one thing, community service can bring real benefits to both the community and ourselves. It helps create a friendly neighborhood and passes kindness to people around us.
Besides, it offers us precious chances to practice communication skills and build up our sense of responsibility. As for the service I can provide, I plan to help the elderly
with daily shopping, organize simple reading activities for children and join street-cleaning work in my spare time.
  From my perspective, we should devote ourselves to community service sincerely. Only in this way can we contribute to a warmer and more harmonious community.
